***NOTES ON THE PARSER:

| Model    | Data needed by model                | Existing struct field                                    | Parser value behind it                                                                                                        | Exact bytes represented                                                                                                                       |
| -------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| A        | pointer to complete frame block     | `h->nal_block_address[file][idx]`                            | `data + sps_off[file][idx]`                                                                                                   | starts at SPS start code                                                                                                                      |
| -------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| A        | length of complete frame block      | `h->nal_block_length[file][idx]`                             | `end_off - sps_off[file][idx]`                                                                                                | SPS start code + SPS NAL header + SPS payload +                                                                                               |
|          |                                     |                                                          |                                                                                                                               | PPS start code + PPS NAL header + PPS payload +                                                                                               |
|          |                                     |                                                          |                                                                                                                               | IDR start code + IDR NAL header + IDR payload                                                                                                 |
| -------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| B config | pointer to rewritten SPS/PPS config | `h->extradata[file]`                                     | `tmp =    sc4 + (data + sps_off[file][idx] + sps_sc_len[file][idx]) +                                                         | `00 00 00 01 + SPS NAL header + SPS payload +                                                                                                 |
|          |                                     |                                                          |           sc4 + (data + pps_off[file][idx] + pps_sc_len[file][idx])`                                                          |  00 00 00 01 + PPS NAL header + PPS payload`                                                                                                  |
| -------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| B config | length of rewritten SPS/PPS config  | `h->extradata_len[file]`                                 |  `4 + (sps_len[file][idx] - sps_sc_len[file][idx]) +                                                                          | byte length of   `00 00 00 01 + SPS NAL header + SPS payload +                                                                                |
|          |                                     |                                                          |   4 + (pps_len[file][idx] - pps_sc_len[file][idx])`                                                                           |                   00 00 00 01 + PPS NAL header + PPS payload`                                                                                 |
| -------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| B frame  | pointer to IDR-only block           | `h->nal_block_address[file][idx] +                           | `(data + sps_off[file][idx]) + (idr_off[file][idx] - sps_off[file][idx]) = data + idr_off[file][idx]`                         | starts at IDR start code                                                                                                                      |
|          |                                     |  h->idr_offset[file][idx]`                               |                                                                                                                               |                                                                                                                                               |
| -------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| B frame  | length of IDR-only block            | `h->idr_length[file][idx]`                               | `idr_len[file][idx]`                                                                                                          | IDR start code + IDR NAL header + IDR payload                                                                                                 |
| -------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |

